</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 12, 2005 - 5:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I hope no one minds if I change my opinion, I had been wondering about this post and decided to go back and look at all the messages in the To BTK thread. I have talked about this in another thread but feel it apply&#39;s to your original Idea LD, to make it short, if you follow our posts, we know each other, we read a post then comment to each other on our thoughts Correct? If you go back and Read this post that LD is talking about as well as other posts in that thread that are not comments but well, took their time, written statements, you can see a pattern. I think Rader wrote them, but he was not communicating with us, he was making a statement about or to One person. Read posts like the one from Raedelina, they are statements He was making, not about his ownself but someone else. So his mindset would have been, to be posting as if that other person were posting. In that case this Post LD would fit. A communication, like in his puzzles, not to us, but someone he was communicating with. If that makes any sense. If not I can show you what I mean<!--/Text--></td></tr>
