</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 15, 2005 - 12:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Sorry Rea if you read this and get offended I just meant the way you write, you think about it first, B I dont have a clue about the server, and Night I have been working my head off on the other victims, like how they are all right off of 135, and that the 5a4b... was not an airport location but an exact location on a train track. In the symbol thread we are breaking this all down. I agree there were many involved in Barn Door, so I agree that that is a possibility, sometimes it&#39;s difficult to seperate the truth from info on other peoples lives he stold, so at this point I believe it when I can prove it  Thanks E.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
