</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nightdriver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 17, 2005 - 11:56 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok, and Ed says that it is one of the very good possibles. But I question taking 7 characters out of a 28 character message and trying to give that it&#39;s own meaning. Have you considered where the nulls may have been? did you notice that when he posted again on the 16th, at about the same time, that he only sent the first 12 characters? And that he put a space between positions 6 and 7? Do you see that out of 36 possible characters, the number 4 appears 7 times?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
