<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11739"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 17, 2005 - 2:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://www.symbols.net/codes.html" target=_top>http://www.symbols.net/codes.html</a> <BR>I have been searching this site on codes it may give us the answer, the ASCll is also there<!--/Text--></td></tr>
