<!--Post: 12008--><!--Time: 1111506719-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12008"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 7:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey guys and gals, the Christ on the cross post was in reply to a post by <BR>&#34;newmexican&#34; made on dec 8 in the &#34;to btk thread&#34; page one. <BR>newmexican also made another post on dec 10, and thats all i could find on him. go read them, very interesting. Newmexican says something about the airforce, and that btk worked on hydraullics in the airforce, well his addy at park city was on hydraullic. Rader may have thought newmexican was Charlie, and thats why he took the time to answer personally. If it was dogbreath at all. <BR>I have felt that dogbreath got as much out of hurting the living left behind families as he did from hurting the ones he killed.  <BR> <BR>I also reread all the &#34;to btk&#34; thread yesterday, and picked out some very interesting ones. I listed them on the &#34;feedback about to btk&#34; thread if your interested.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12008-->
<!--Post: 12012--><!--Time: 1111507725-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12012"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 8:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->EVERYONE...yes yes yes - read Itty&#39;s post one the &#34;feedback to btk&#34;  really really interesting and creepy at the same time! <BR>Fascinating Itty.....can&#39;t wait to see what you come up with next.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12012-->
<!--Post: 12082--><!--Time: 1111554982-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12082"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 9:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Itty, keep looking at the messages, You will see many, The idea of Lewis came from there Will_graham Neon Bright, Look at the messages that are making statements about someone, the statements are not about BTK they are about others, BTK  was talking to others, not us. Crist on the Cross, if you code it, comes out again like the other one D=4 R=18, Neon Bright, becomes Begin North as Rader did after the Otero murders, and Ie north tO Knechi or how ever it is spelled. Some of the other names, are names of serial killers and child abductors. I recieved a mail today someone telling us to look at the post from Posted on Thursday, March 03, 2005 - 7:29 am:      <BR>-------------------------------------------------- ------------------------------ <BR>Has any one heard or read anything from Richerich? He was the only person that posted information about Park City and Seneca St. at the same time. On Thursday Jan. 27 &#40;North of Kenchi&#41; D. Rader ownes property at both location!  <BR>There are many, Like Kent, pay attention to the information in the messages, this has been very helpful to us...Thanks E.  <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
