<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12085"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 22, 2005 - 9:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->E - There is a cemetary Northwest of Kechi, you drive right past Mrs. Davis&#39; home to get to it. Growing up - I knew of a Richard Rich or something &#40;Rich&#41; that lived near Kechi. Where does Rader own property? I can probably tell you what is around it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
